---
import ModuleLayout from '../../../../layouts/ModuleLayout.astro';
---
<ModuleLayout moduleId="eyes" activeTab="soap" label="Clinical Module" title="👁️ Eyes — Ophthalmology" description="Assessment framework, SOAP note, resources, and quiz for ophthalmic presentations" activePage="eyes">
<div style="margin-bottom:20px"><h3 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px">Example SOAP Note</h3><p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.88rem">Click each section to expand. Example: acute unilateral bacterial conjunctivitis.</p></div>
<div class="soap-wrapper">
  <div class="soap-header"><h3>Acute Red Eye — Adult Patient</h3><span class="soap-meta">NP Clinic · Primary Care · Example only</span></div>
  <div class="soap-section"><button class="soap-toggle" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleSoap(this)"><div class="soap-letter S">S</div><h4>Subjective</h4><svg class="soap-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="soap-body"><div class="soap-field"><label>Presenting Complaint</label><p>34-year-old female, 2-day history of right eye redness and discharge.</p></div><div class="soap-field"><label>HPC</label><p>Onset 2 days ago, gradual. Right eye only. Yellow-green mucopurulent discharge, worst on waking. Grittiness and mild itch. Denies pain, photophobia, or VA change. No halos or floaters. Niece had similar symptoms 5 days ago.</p></div><div class="soap-field"><label>Relevant History</label><p>Soft daily contact lenses — still wearing. NKDA. No regular medications.</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="soap-section"><button class="soap-toggle" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleSoap(this)"><div class="soap-letter O">O</div><h4>Objective</h4><svg class="soap-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="soap-body"><div class="soap-field"><label>Vitals</label><p>BP 118/72 | HR 74 | Temp 36.8°C | SpO₂ 98%</p></div><div class="soap-field"><label>Examination</label><ul><li>VA: R 6/6, L 6/6 (unaided)</li><li>Pupils: PEARL, no RAPD</li><li>R eye: diffuse conjunctival injection, mucopurulent discharge, cornea clear</li><li>L eye: normal</li><li>Pre-auricular nodes: not palpable</li></ul></div></div></div>
  <div class="soap-section"><button class="soap-toggle" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleSoap(this)"><div class="soap-letter A">A</div><h4>Assessment</h4><svg class="soap-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="soap-body"><div class="soap-field"><label>Diagnosis</label><p>Acute bacterial conjunctivitis, right eye (H10.029)</p></div><div class="soap-field"><label>Differentials</label><ul><li>Viral conjunctivitis — less likely: purulent discharge, epidemiological contact</li><li>Allergic conjunctivitis — less likely: unilateral, purulent</li><li>Acute angle-closure glaucoma — excluded: no pain, VA intact, cornea clear</li></ul></div></div></div>
  <div class="soap-section"><button class="soap-toggle" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleSoap(this)"><div class="soap-letter P">P</div><h4>Plan</h4><svg class="soap-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button><div class="soap-body"><div class="soap-field"><label>Management</label><ul><li>Chloramphenicol 0.5% QID for 5 days</li><li>Cease contact lenses until 48h post-resolution; discard current lens and case</li><li>Hygiene education: handwashing, own towels</li></ul></div><div class="soap-field"><label>Safety Netting</label><ul><li>Return immediately: vision changes, pain, photophobia</li><li>Return if no improvement by 48h</li></ul></div></div></div>
</div>
<script>function toggleSoap(btn){const body=btn.nextElementSibling;const isOpen=btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!isOpen));body.classList.toggle('open',!isOpen);}</script>
</ModuleLayout>
